      "severity": "fix",
      "topic": "bug",
      "confidence": "high",
      "title": "totalPages overcounts when user_count is an exact multiple of limit",
      "body": "`Math.floor(user_count / limit) + 1` gives 2 pages for 50 members at limit 50. `showingLast` (currentPage == totalPages) is then false on page 1, so `next` (line 29) sets offset to 50 and loads an empty page. The pager then shows `2/2` with no members. The same off-by-one hits 100, 150 and so on. Use `Math.ceil(user_count / limit)`. `currentPage` (line 8) is correct as written.",
      "anchor": "diff"
    },
    {
      "path": "app/controllers/groups_controller.rb",
      "line": 22,
      "severity": "consider",
      "topic": "bug",
      "confidence": "medium",
      "title": "limit and offset from params are unvalidated for all groups",
      "body": "The old code applied limit and offset only to automatic groups. Now every request uses them. `limit` is unbounded, so a huge value dumps the whole group. A negative `limit` or `offset` reaches SQL and raises a 500. Clamp them, for example `limit = [[limit, 1].max, 200].min` and `offset = [offset, 0].max`.",
      "anchor": "diff"
    },
    {
      "path": "app/assets/javascripts/admin/controllers/admin-group.js.es6",
      "line": 62,
      "severity": "consider",
      "topic": "bug",
      "confidence": "medium",
      "title": "usernames input is not cleared after adding members",
      "body": "`addMembers` leaves `usernames` set (the TODO acknowledges this). Clicking Add twice re-submits the same names. Clear `usernames` after the PUT succeeds.",
      "anchor": "diff"
    }
  ],
